msgstr "{0} ongestuurde Simkl-opdaterings ouer as 30 dae is weggegooi"

msgctxt "#32312"
msgid "When a movie ends at or past the percentage, a 1-10 pick appears and goes to Simkl. A movie you rated in Kodi or watched before is not asked, nor are shows and episodes."
msgstr "Wanneer 'n fliek by of ná die persentasie eindig, verskyn 'n keuse van 1-10 wat na Simkl gaan. Daar word nie gevra vir 'n fliek wat jy in Kodi gegradeer of voorheen gekyk het nie, en ook nie vir TV-vertonings en episodes nie."

msgctxt "#32313"
msgid "the kept copy of the Simkl history could not be saved"
msgstr "die bewaarde kopie van die Simkl-geskiedenis kon nie gestoor word nie"

msgctxt "#32314"
msgid "{0} is already watched in Kodi, so it was not moved to Plan to watch"
msgstr "{0} is reeds in Kodi gekyk, dus is dit nie na Wil kyk geskuif nie"
